    "law": "At each air–glass interface, the normal-incidence power reflectance is R=((1.5-1)/(1.5+1))^2=0.04. Summing the incoherent transmitted beams gives P_transmitted=P_incident*(1-R)^2/(1-R^2)=P_incident*(12/13). Thus the base transmitted power is 50*(12/13)=46.153846 mW.",
